    # "I felt my bones shatter in quick succession and then form again, the broken pieces growing, becoming larger, stronger."
    "骨が次々と砕けていくのを感じた、そして再構成される、破片は成長し、より大きく、より強くなっていく。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:119
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_235205d7:

    # "The pain forced me to my knees, and I let out a roar of agony as I felt my spine elongating before the pain travelled to my head and my mind cracked."
    "痛みに膝を折られ、背骨が伸びていくのを感じたかと思うと、苦痛の咆哮を上げた。その痛みが頭へと移り、やがて精神が軋んだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:120
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_0d94ada9:

    # "Fragments of my thoughts were being melded with the symbiote; I could feel its long fingers on the inside of my skull as it picked through my mind."
    "思考の断片が共生体と溶け合っていた。それは私の精神を探りながら、頭蓋の内側に長い指を這わせているのが感じられた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:121
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_fdf206a5:

    # "My whole body burned as I felt it mould and shape itself to me, creating a monstrous new form."
    "全身が燃えるように熱く、それが私に合わせて形を変え、怪物めいた新たな姿を形成していく。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:122
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_a01885fa:

    # "Somewhere on the edge of my vision I could see Markus lying on the floor, his head in his hands, screaming."
    "視界の端で、マーカスが床に倒れ込み、手で頭を抱えて叫んでいるのが見えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:123
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_85ca6baf:

    # "Any hopes of it being a painless transformation were thwarted as the agonising ordeal continued."
    "楽に済むという望みは、痛みに満ちた試練が続くにつれ打ち砕かれた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:124
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_9f8d681b:

    # "Finally, as I felt strange snake like creatures force their way out of my back, I stood upright to stare at Markus... or at least... what I {i}knew{/i} was Markus."
    "やがて、背中から異様な蛇のような生き物が這い出てくる感覚とともに、私はまっすぐに立ち上がってマーカスを見つめた…少なくとも…私が{i}理解している{/i}マーカスという存在を。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:131
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_4fdfcee7:

    # "His voice was distorted, {i}inhuman{/i}."
    "声は歪んで、{i}非人間的{/i}だった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:132
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_2a306dbb:

    # "I gawped down at my clawed hands and then towards the slither of one of my tentacles as it slid over my shoulder and turned to look at me inquisitively before retreating."
    "私は鉤爪の生えた自分の手を見つめ、次に肩越しに滑り込んできた触手の一筋が、物珍しそうに私の方を向いてから引っ込んでいく様をぼんやりと眺めた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:133
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_0cfb0550:

    # "Curiously, Markus did not possess any of the strange tentacles that protruded from my back, but instead, large white wings that kicked up the hot sand as they beat ferociously behind him."
    "奇妙なことに、マーカスは私の背中から生えていたような不思議な触手は持っておらず、代わりに大きな白い翼が彼の背後で激しく羽ばたき、熱い砂を巻き上げていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:134
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_747d7458:

    # MC "How do you feel?"
    MC "気分はどう？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:135
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_2b15eed7:

    # "It seemed both of our voices had changed to be more guttural, but they were clear enough to understand."
    "私たちの声は、どちらも唸り声のように変わっていたが、それでもはっきりと聞き取れるほどだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:136
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_209f5300:

    # BLACK "It will be less painful the next time..."
    BLACK "次は、痛みは少なくなる…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:137
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_8efe98d9:

    # WHITE "Quicker as well..."
    WHITE "より速く... さらに。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:138
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_d4859430:

    # "Examining ourselves thoroughly, Markus began to laugh."
    "自分たちの姿をじっくり眺めて、マーカスは笑い出した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:139
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_28b878b7:

    # MARKUS "Incredible!"
    MARKUS "すごい!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:141
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_d4e32c2f:

    # MARKUS "Can you feel it? It’s like fire in my veins!"
    MARKUS "感じられるか？　この血管を駆け巡る炎のように!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:142
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_1dfde4e8:

    # MC "I feel... {i}strong,{/i}"
    MC "感じる…{i}強い、{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:143
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_4b04075e:

    # MARKUS "I wonder..."
    MARKUS "なんだろう…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:145
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_3d171ada:

    # "Markus sprinted forward, launching himself into the air as his wings lifted him off the ground."
    "マルクスは全速で駆け出し、翼が地面から体を持ち上げると同時に、空中へ飛び立った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:146
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_a1321702:

    # "With an elated cry of joy, he called to me to keep up with him."
    "歓喜の声を上げて、彼は私に付いて来いと呼びかけた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:149
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_0c33d2bc:

    # "Chasing him like some great bird in the sky, I found instinctively that sprinting after him on all fours meant that I could achieve speeds faster than any human could ever hope to."
    "大空を翔ける巨鳥のように彼を追って、私は四つん這いで駆ければ、人間業とは思えぬ速度が出せることに本能で気がついた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:151
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_71005e1e:

    # "Suddenly, my tentacles slammed into the ground, throwing me along in steady motions as we crossed huge swathes of land in no time."
    "突然、触手が地面を打ち付け、安定した動きで私を運びながら、あっという間に広大な土地を横断していった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:152
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_42c07e27:

    # "Finally, I caught up to Markus and the two of us settled down to catch our breath."
    "やっとマーカスに追いつき、二人は腰を下ろして息を整えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:157
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_662e09b6:

    # MARKUS "Ha... Not bad!"
    MARKUS "は…悪くない!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:158
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_c6a9a4fd:

    # MC "Markus, do you know what this means?"
    MC "Markus、これが何を意味するか分かる？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:159
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_4e743bf4:

    # MC "This changes everything! We can turn the tides of the war with these things!"
    MC "これで全てが変わる!　この発明品で戦争の流れを変えられる!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:160
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_328c3275:

    # MARKUS "... Heh... Let’s not get too ahead of ourselves."
    MARKUS "……ふっ……調子に乗るのもいい加減にな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:161
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_d663e663:

    # MARKUS "How about we just focus on {i}our{/i} plan."
    MARKUS "{i}私たちの{/i}計画に集中しよう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:162
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_d3aa162c:

    # MARKUS "Let’s save ourselves first before we think about saving the kingd—"
    MARKUS "まず自分たちを救おう、王のことを考える前に―"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:163
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_5f9e5b68:

    # "Suddenly, we both heard the sound of a battle cry and blades loudly clashing."
    "突然、我々二人の耳に鬨の声と刃鳴りが響き渡った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:164
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_30e8207c:

    # MC "... Could it be Scouts?"
    MC "偵察隊なのか…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:165
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_dcca44f6:

    # MARKUS "We’d have spotted them if it was."
    MARKUS "そうだったら、とっくに見つけていたはずだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:166
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_ddc1f1da:

    # MC "Come on! Let’s take a look!"
    MC "さあ!見てみよう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:168
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_1869deac:

    # MC "As we made our way towards the erratic sounds, we came across a group of Demorai ferociously attacking an..."
    MC "不規則な音の方へと進んでいくと、激しく何かを襲っているデモライの群れに出くわした…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:172
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_c91cc98c:

    # MC "{i}Orc?{/i}"
    MC "{i}オーク？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:173
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_32603ed4:

    # MARKUS "What is an orc doing in Alderay?"
    MARKUS "オークがアルダレイで何をしているんだ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:174
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_a88f4b0f:

    # "As one of the beasts lunged at her, she swung her axes with ferocious speed, slamming the blade through its skull as it reached out to grab her."
    "一匹の魔物が彼女に襲いかかるやいなや、彼女は両手の斧を荒々しい速度で振るった。刃がその頭蓋を打ち抜いたのは、魔物が彼女を捕らえんと手を伸ばしてきた時だった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:175
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_b99f8061:

    # "She spun on her heels, deflecting a blow from the other before slicing through its neck and severing its head in one quick, clean cut."
    "彼女は踵を返し、相手の一撃を弾き飛ばすと、素早く鋭くその首を斬り落とした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:176
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_7713ce0a:

    # "As she pulled her blade from the skull of the first, more Demorai descended, incensed by the bloodshed."
    "彼女が最初の敵の頭蓋骨から刃を引き抜くと、さらにデモライが降り立った。流血に激昂して。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:177
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_9d459c1c:

    # MARKUS "What should we do?"
    MARKUS "どうしよう？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:185
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_6d560f29:

    # "Me and Markus hastily departed the scene, listening as we heard the clashing of blades followed by screams... {i}And then the most awful silence.{/i}"
    "私とマーカスは急いでその場を離れ、剣戟の音と悲鳴を耳にしながら…{i}その、最悪な静寂。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:192
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_7a5f7610:

    # "Making our way back to Novaras, we've barely exchanged looks, let alone words."
    "ノヴァラスへ戻る道すがら、私たちは言葉を交わすなんておろか、視線を合わせることさえほとんどなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:193
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_c2fbf28b:

    # "Our minds racing with questions, we found ourselves in front of the city's massive walls again."
    "疑問が駆け巡る私たちは、再び街の巨大な城壁の前に立ち尽くしていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:200
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_0920d4d8:

    # MARKUS "These {i}things{/i} inside us..."
    MARKUS "私たちの中にあるこの{i}もの{/i}は…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:201
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_8e11f116:

    # MC "Yeah, I think we should~"
    MC "うん、そうしようか〜"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:202
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_59c7b32a:

    # MARKUS "I'll take a walk. Alone."
    MARKUS "散歩に行く。一人で。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:203
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_88a37e3c:

    # MARKUS "Join me later in the tavern, we'll talk."
    MARKUS "後で酒場で合流しましょう、話があります。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:205
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_69f8dfa8:

    # "There I stood, my new inner companion keenly observing every thought drifting across my mind."
    "そこに私は立っていた。新たな内的な相棒が、私の心を漂う思考の一つ一つを鋭く見つめながら。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:206
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_916656da:

    # "As I watched Markus walking towards the city gates, I couldn't help but wonder..."
    "マーカスが街の門に向かって歩いて行くのを見つめながら、私は思わず考えてしまった…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:207
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_630c2e0c:

    # MC "...What do we do now?"
    MC "…これからどうする？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:208
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_9a8a330c:

    # MC "What do {i}I{/i} do now?"
    MC "{i}私{/i}は今、何をすればいい？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:212
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_80ff883a:

    # MARKUS "But it’s an orc!"
    MARKUS "でも、オークだよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:213
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_26079539:

    # MC "It doesn’t matter! They’re going to rip her apart!"
    MC "どうでもいい!
彼女を引き裂くんだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:214
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_3fea1c49:

    # MARKUS "Aaargh! Fine!"
    MARKUS "ちくしょう!分かったよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:215
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_01b98172:

    # MC "HEY! OVER HERE!"
    MC "おい!こっちだよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:216
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_2f323b10:

    # MC "As the orc spun around to look our way, the Demorai were momentarily distracted as we came hurtling towards them."
    MC "オークが振り返ってこっちを見た瞬間、デモライたちは我々が襲いかかっていく様子に一瞬気を取られた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:223
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_b4651d8d:

    # MC "For a moment, the orc drew her weapons against us, expecting us to attack her before we launched ourselves backwards and began to slash at the Demorai."
    MC "一瞬、オークは我々に向けて武器を構えた。我々が彼女を攻撃すると思い込んでいたのだが、我々は後方へ飛び退き、デモライに向けて斬りかかっていった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:224
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_ca17ee27:

    # VES @ angry "What the hell are {b}you?!{/b}"
    VES @ angry "{b}貴様…何者だ？{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:225
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_307e2408:

    # MARKUS "Lady, questions later!"
    MARKUS "お嬢様、質問は後にして!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:226
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_883b7548:

    # MARKUS "FIGHTING NOW!"
    MARKUS "ファイティング、いざ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:238
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_baeed6be:

    # MC @ talk "{i}*Huff*{/i} Are you—"
    MC @ talk "{i}はあ{/i} あなたは――"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:245
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_33b06d92:

    # "The orc drew her bloodied axes in our direction."
    "オークは血塗られた斧をこちらへと向けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:246
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_26f15437:

    # VES @ angry "What are you?"
    VES @ angry "お前は何者だ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:247
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_840dcc09:

    # VES @ angry "Some kinds of... demons?"
    VES @ angry "いくつかの種類の... 魔物？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:255
# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:256
# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:257
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_3ada0a82:

    # VES @ angry "Don’t look like no humans I ever saw."
    VES @ angry "人間には見えないな、今まで見たどの人間とも違う"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:261
# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:266
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_0f306027:

    # "The orc began to relax as she smirked at us both."
    "オークはゆったりとした仕草で、俺たち二人へ不敵な笑みを浮かべた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr04.rpy:267
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToValleyWithMarkus_8daaf04e:

